Package: supertux2
Version: 0.6.3
Section: games
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Depends: libc6, libstdc++6, libgcc-s1, zlib1g, libpng16-16, libfreetype6, libglew2.2, libgl1, libsdl2-2.0-0, libsdl2-image-2.0-0, libopenal1, libvorbisfile3, libphysfs1, libboost-filesystem1.74.0, libcurl3-gnutls, libraqm0, fonts-nanum, fonts-roboto-unhinted
Maintainer: Juan Pablo Lozano <libredeb@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://www.supertux.org/
Description: Classic 2D jump 'n run sidescroller with Tux
 SuperTux is a classic 2D jump 'n run sidescroller game in a similar
 style like the original SuperMario games. You play the role of Tux the
 Penguin, who must rescue Penny from the hands of the evil Nolok.
 .
 This package repackages the official upstream binary and data files
 from Debian's supertux/supertux-data packages with a custom icon and
 a default GamerCard-friendly configuration (720x720 fullscreen).
